** Minimal multi-pathway fixture based on EPA AERMOD v26135 syntax
CO STARTING
CO TITLEONE AERMODKit v26135 fixture
CO MODELOPT DFAULT CONC ELEV
CO AVERTIME 1 ANNUAL
CO POLLUTID NO2
CO RUNORNOT RUN
CO FINISHED

SO STARTING
SO ELEVUNIT METERS
SO LOCATION STACK1 POINT 500.0 600.0 10.0
SO SRCPARAM STACK1 1.0 50.0 400.0 15.0 2.0
SO SRCGROUP ALL STACK1
SO FINISHED

RE STARTING
RE ELEVUNIT METERS
RE GRIDCART GRID1 STA
RE GRIDCART GRID1 XYINC 0.0 3 100.0 0.0 3 100.0
RE GRIDCART GRID1 END
RE FINISHED

ME STARTING
ME SURFFILE met/site.sfc
ME PROFFILE met/site.pfl
ME SURFDATA 00001 2024
ME UAIRDATA 00002 2024
ME PROFBASE 10.0 METERS
ME STARTEND 2024 01 01 2024 12 31
ME FINISHED

OU STARTING
OU RECTABLE ALLAVE FIRST
OU MAXTABLE 1 ALL
OU SUMMFILE output/summary.sum
OU FINISHED
